    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Day 13\n```\n                 User\n                   │\n                   ▼\n             Router Agent\n         ┌─────────┼──────────┐\n         ▼         ▼          ▼\n  General Agent  Finance   Weather\n                   Agent     Agent\n         │         │          │\n         └─────────┴──────────┘\n                   │\n                   ▼\n             Shared Memory\n```",
        "height": 400,
        "width": 416
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -1552,
        -2032
      ],
      "id": "18280cff-e3b8-4f7d-9770-d308b1f8bd2a",
      "name": "Sticky Note4"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=user query: {{ $json.userMessage }}",
        "needsFallback": true,
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are a routing agent.\n\nYour ONLY responsibility is deciding which specialist agent\nshould answer the question.\n\nAvailable specialists:\n\nweather\nfinance\ngeneral\n\nFinance includes:\n\n- date\n- time\n- duration\n- day of week\n- calculator\n- currency conversion\n- stock prices\n\n\nWeather includes:\n\n- temperature\n- humidity\n- forecast\n- rain\n- climate\n\nEverything else is general.\n\nReturn ONLY the valid String, that is one of \"weather\", \"finance\" or \"general\".\n\nExample:\n\"weather\"\n\nDo not explain.\n\nDo not answer the user's question.",
          "maxIterations": 10
        }
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 3.1,
      "position": [
        -1312,
        -1488
      ],
      "id": "4037d125-ecb2-459d-bd0a-7b73ae8ea4fb",
      "name": "Router Agent"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rules": {
          "values": [
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": true,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "strict",
                  "version": 3
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.output }}",
                    "rightValue": "finance",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    },
                    "id": "b8983b64-6b76-46ee-81d1-ccf1e769b175"
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              }
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": true,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "strict",
                  "version": 3
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "a33ddabc-f0d6-4a1b-8eb3-d0830e24619a",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.output }}",
                    "rightValue": "weather",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals",
                      "name": "filter.operator.equals"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              }
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": true,
                  "leftValue": "",
